      "writtenOn": "2023-10-24T10:48:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is it wise to have fine-grained locking in this class? It seems confusing that some methods don\u0027t take any locks but some do. Things would be much simpler if there was only one class lock that covers all the methods. Is there a reason we can\u0027t do that?",
